  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/533d14b5-7074-4dd0-906f-7d669b48be50-image.png\" style=\"width: 281px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>Let <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;S(z)</mi></math><br />By Rotation theorem, rotating about <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math>, we get<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
